{
  "slug": "gws-connector",
  "name": "Gws Connector",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Multi-account Google Workspace MCP server — connect multiple Gmail, Google Calendar, and Google Drive accounts with smart routing. Target accounts by label, email, or domain. Supports per-account OAuth credentials for different organizations. 21 tools for mail (search, read, draft, send, labels), calendar (list, get, create), and drive (search, read, list). Tokens stored securely in OS keychain.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**, **1 agent**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `add-account` (Connect a new Google account to the GWS connector with a custom label), `configure` (Step-by-step setup wizard for the GWS connector), `list-accounts` (Show all connected GWS accounts with their labels and default status), `reauth` (Re-authorize a connected GWS account to refresh tokens or pick up new OAuth scopes without changing account settings), `remove-account` (Disconnect a Google account from the GWS connector and delete its tokens), `set-default` (Set the default GWS account used when no account is specified)\n- **Agents** (1): `workspace-context` (Behavioral guide for handling multi-account Google Workspace operations)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `gws-connector`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install gws-connector@claude-community` from `orieg/gws-connector`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 6,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
